<title>USA: John H. Harland Co Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>John H. Harland Co Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.45		    $0.36</p>
<p> Net			 14,038		   10,958</p>
<p> Sales		    155,912		  141,348</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  30,984		   30,585</p>
<p>				Nine months</p>
<p> Shr    loss		$0.93		    $1.19</p>
<p> Net    loss	     28,579		   36,189</p>
<p> Sales		    457,804		  415,707</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  30,836		   30,534</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: First Call consensus earnings estimate for the 1996 third quarter was $0.44 per share.</p>
<p>All net and per share figures are profit figures, except for loss noted for the 1996 nine-month period.</p>
<p>The nine-month per share loss includes $63.5 million or $2.06 per share after tax for second quarter restructuring charges and expensing of in-process research and development costs for the OKRA acquisition.</p>
</text>
